    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d123">

                <pb facs="0805" n="655" sameAs="frus:frus1907p2/pg655"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 6775/152.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">President Roosevelt
                        to the President of Nicaragua.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1907-10-14"><hi rendition="#italic">October 14,
                        1907</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I highly appreciate your cordial message and hope for beneficial results from the
                    approaching conference, at which a representative of the United States will
                    attend conformably with the protocol and the request of the five Republics.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Theodore
                    Roosevelt.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
